0..83 Comment "/// This source calls recursions staged past their first parameter at named values."
84..87 Comment "///"
88..162 Comment "/// It pins how the kernel unfolds a constant at a staged fixpoint\'s gate."
163..166 Comment "///"
167..247 Comment "/// The lowering stages `le` under its second-parameter case. Its fixpoint takes"
248..325 Comment "/// the first parameter as a leading argument. At a named value, the fixpoint"
326..403 Comment "/// stops at the gate. The checker unfolds the name there. The kernel replays"
404..463 Comment "/// this step at the staged argument before the gate opens."
464..467 Comment "///"
468..484 Comment "/// - see: #3387"
485..500 Comment "/// - see: #626"
